{"id":"t4nxw8dl9nqglt03pvbc8nvzt","title":"氢气火焰为何会变色及影响因素","originalTitle":"Why hydrogen flames can glow orange, then turn nearly invisible","summary":"研究发现氢气火焰的颜色变化主要由空气中的钠含量决定，钠含量高时火焰呈明显橙色，钠含量低时火焰几乎不可见。这影响了家用氢气灶具的安全性和可靠性。研究人员建议采用其他检测技术，如紫外线或红外线火焰检测器，以提高氢气设备的性能，使其在不同环境条件下都能可靠工作。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261118065509.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T10:10:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T12:43:53.500Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T12:43:53.500Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["研究成果"],"score":47,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"6f0ee1ba-6f18-4669-a129-aaae38c7018f","title":"氢气火焰颜色变化与钠含量相关研究"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"6f0ee1ba-6f18-4669-a129-aaae38c7018f","title":"氢气火焰颜色变化与钠含量相关研究"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fPU5--HPp02U","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}